sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS
    participant Operator as kagenti-operator<br/>Controller Manager
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant AgentPod as Agent Pod
    participant AuthBridge as AuthBridge Sidecar<br/>(proxy/envoy/lite)
    participant TokenBrk as token-broker
    participant SPIRE as SPIRE Workload API
    participant Upstream as Upstream Agent/Service

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Operator: Agent Deployment Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: CREATE AgentRuntime CR
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate AgentRuntime<br/>POST /validate-agent-kagenti-dev-v1alpha1-agentruntime
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (AgentRuntime)
        Operator->>CertMgr: Create Certificate CR<br/>(TLS for agent)
        CertMgr-->>Operator: Certificate issued
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment/StatefulSet<br/>+ Service + NetworkPolicy + RBAC
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over AgentPod,AuthBridge: AuthBridge Sidecar Injection
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Pod CREATE event
        Webhook->>Webhook: inject.kagenti.io<br/>Mutate Pod spec
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Inject AuthBridge sidecar<br/>+ init containers + volumes
        K8sAPI->>AgentPod: Schedule Pod with sidecar
        AuthBridge->>SPIRE: Request X.509-SVID<br/>(if mTLS configured)
        SPIRE-->>AuthBridge: X.509-SVID certificate
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Upstream,AuthBridge: Inbound Request Flow (Reverse Proxy)
        Upstream->>AuthBridge: HTTPS request<br/>(mTLS if SPIFFE configured)
        AuthBridge->>AuthBridge: JWT Validation<br/>(JWKS endpoint)
        AuthBridge->>AuthBridge: OPA Policy Evaluation<br/>(Rego authorization)
        AuthBridge->>AuthBridge: Protocol Parse<br/>(A2A/MCP/Inference)
        AuthBridge->>AgentPod: Forward to agent container<br/>(localhost)
        AgentPod-->>AuthBridge: Response
        AuthBridge-->>Upstream: Response (mTLS)
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note over AgentPod,TokenBrk: Outbound Request Flow (Forward Proxy)
        AgentPod->>AuthBridge: Outbound HTTPS request
        AuthBridge->>TokenBrk: Token exchange<br/>POST /sessions/token
        TokenBrk-->>AuthBridge: Exchanged token<br/>(audience-scoped)
        AuthBridge->>AuthBridge: Protocol Parse<br/>(A2A/MCP/Inference)
        AuthBridge->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>(mTLS + bearer token)
        Upstream-->>AuthBridge: Response
        AuthBridge-->>AgentPod: Response
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over User,Operator: AgentCard Lifecycle
        User->>K8sAPI: CREATE AgentCard CR
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate AgentCard<br/>POST /validate-agent-kagenti-dev-v1alpha1-agentcard
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (AgentCard)
        Operator->>Operator: Reconcile NetworkPolicy<br/>+ Sync card to agents
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Update AgentCard status
    end
